        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 18042, Deco Narrow Plate Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith clean lines and a modern retro plate, the Deco Narrow Plate Lever is an artful blending of popular silhouettes that give it a timelessness that is truly beautiful. This Omnia made latchset is available in equally beautiful finishes: polished brass, polished chrome, and satin chrome. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. For interior doors with 1-3/8\" thicknesses and either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions. Good for residential and commercial uses, it meets ADA requirements. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C13PC3_size.gif?v=1704354765\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Narrow Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Deco Narrow Plate Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ADA accessibility requirements.</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>All critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout.</li>\r\n<li>For commercial and residential use.</li>\r\n<li>For interior use only.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy function features a privacy mortise bolt constructed of a metal case and featuring a solid brass bolt underneath the lever and latch. It has an emergency release on outside plate.</li>\r\n<li>The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. <b>Does Not</b> fit standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Interior Narrow Plate Deco Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-7/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Privacy Function Turnpiece: 1-5/8\" x 1-1/8 proj.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy</b>: For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 1 lever, 1 backplate, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 backplates, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates by lever from either side of door. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, tubular latch, spindle and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Upper latch operates by lever from either side of door. Locks by privacy bolt with turnpiece on inside an emergency release on outside plate. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, spindle, mounting hardware, privacy turnpiece, lever operated tubular latch, and thumbturn operated privacy mortise bolt and case.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/locking-door-bolt-size.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"255\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Deco Narrow Plate Lever",
                "description": "Modern Narrow Plate Latchset Omnia 18042 - With clean lines and a modern retro plate, the Deco Narrow Plate Lever is an artful blending of popular silhouettes that give it a timelessness that is truly beautiful. This Omnia made latchset is available in equally beautiful finishes: polished brass, polished chrome, and satin chrome. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. For interior doors with 1-3/8 inch thicknesses and either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions. Good for residential and commercial uses, it meets ADA requirements.",
                "keywords": "Modern Narrow Plate Latchsets, Deco Narrow Plate Levers, Interior Narrow Plate Deco Leversets, omnia narrow plate latchsets, OMN-18042, Omnia 18042, ada levers, passages levers, privacy levers, high end levers, contemporary levers, modern levers, solid brass levers, modern levers"
            },
